$ gccli --help
Usage: gccli <command> [flags]

Garmin Connect CLI

Flags:
  -h, --help              Show context-sensitive help.
  -j, --json              Output as JSON ($GCCLI_JSON).
      --plain             Output as plain text (TSV) ($GCCLI_PLAIN).
      --header            Print the column names as the first line of --plain
                          output ($GCCLI_HEADER).
      --color="auto"      Color mode: auto, always, never ($GCCLI_COLOR).
      --account=STRING    Garmin account email ($GCCLI_ACCOUNT).
      --units="auto"      Unit system for distances, speeds, paces,
                          elevations and weights in table and plain output:
                          auto (Garmin profile), metric, statute_us, statute_uk
                          ($GCCLI_UNITS).
      --version           Print version information.

Commands:
  auth login                       Log in to Garmin Connect.
  auth status                      Show authentication status.
  auth remove                      Remove stored credentials.
  auth token                       Print current access token, refreshing it
                                   first when expired.
  auth export                      Export credentials for transfer to another
                                   machine.
  auth import                      Import credentials from another machine.
  activities list                  List recent activities.
  activities count                 Show total activity count.
  activities search                Search activities by date range.
  activities favorites             List your favorite activities.
  activities types                 List all activity types supported by Garmin.
  activities pending               List pending activities.
  activities stats view            Show activity totals by activity type.
  activities stats monthly         Show monthly activity totals by activity
                                   type.
  activities privacy status        Show the last privacy change of past
                                   activities.
  activities privacy set           Change the privacy of all past activities,
                                   or of past activities of some types.
  activity summary                 Show activity summary.
  activity details                 Show full activity details.
  activity splits                  Show activity splits.
  activity typed-splits            Show typed splits.
  activity split-summaries         Show split summaries.
  activity weather                 Show weather conditions.
  activity hr-zones                Show heart rate time in zones.
  activity power-zones             Show power time in zones.
  activity segments                List the segments that an activity crossed.
  activity exercise-sets show      Show exercise sets.
  activity exercise-sets set       Set exercise sets for a strength training
                                   activity.
  activity gear                    Show linked gear.
  activity comments list           List the comments on an activity.
  activity comments add            Add a comment to an activity.
  activity comments edit           Change the text of your comment on an
                                   activity.
  activity comments delete         Delete a comment on an activity.
  activity comments likes list     List the likes of a comment.
  activity comments likes add      Like a comment.
  activity comments likes remove
                                   Remove your like from a comment.
  activity likes list              List the likes of an activity.
  activity likes add               Like an activity.
  activity likes remove            Remove your like from an activity.
  activity download                Download activity file.
  activity upload                  Upload an activity file (FIT/GPX/TCX).
  activity create                  Create a manual activity.
  activity rename                  Rename an activity.
  activity retype                  Change activity type.
  activity describe                Set or clear the description of an activity.
  activity privacy                 Change who can see an activity.
  activity legs                    List the legs of a multisport activity.
  activity trim                    Trim the start or end of an activity.
  activity restore                 Restore the original of a trimmed activity.
  activity favorite                Mark an activity as a favorite.
  activity unfavorite              Remove the favorite mark from an activity.
  activity delete                  Delete an activity.
  workouts list                    List workouts.
  workouts detail                  View workout details.
  workouts download                Download workout as FIT file.
  workouts upload                  Upload workout from JSON file.
  workouts update                  Update an existing workout from a JSON file.
  workouts create                  Create a workout with sport type and optional
                                   targets.
  workouts copy                    Copy a workout.
  workouts send                    Send a workout to a device at its next sync.
                                   Undo: devices messages cancel.
  workouts types                   List workout types.
  workouts sport-types             List the sport types a workout can have.
  workouts schedule add            Add a workout to the schedule.
  workouts schedule list           List scheduled workouts for a date.
  workouts schedule remove         Remove a scheduled workout from the calendar.
  workouts schedule export         Export the workout schedule from a start
                                   date.
  workouts benchmarks list         List strength benchmarks.
  workouts benchmarks set          Set a strength benchmark from a weight and
                                   reps.
  workouts benchmarks clear        Clear a strength benchmark.
  workouts delete                  Delete a workout.
  health summary                   Show daily health summary.
  health steps view                Show step chart data for a date.
  health steps daily               Show daily step totals for a date range.
  health steps weekly              Show weekly step totals.
  health steps monthly             Show monthly step totals.
  health calories weekly           Show weekly calorie totals.
  health pushes weekly             Show weekly wheelchair push totals.
  health pushes monthly            Show monthly wheelchair push totals.
  health lifetime-totals           Show lifetime totals.
  health hr view                   Show heart rate data for a date.
  health hr daily                  Show daily heart rate statistics for a date
                                   range.
  health hr weekly                 Show weekly heart rate statistics.
  health rhr                       Show resting heart rate data.
  health floors view               Show floors climbed for a date.
  health floors daily              Show daily floors climbed for a date range.
  health floors weekly             Show weekly floors climbed.
  health sleep view                Show sleep data for a date.
  health sleep naps view           Show naps for a date.
  health sleep naps add            Add a nap for today. Garmin takes naps only
                                   for the current day.
  health sleep naps delete         Delete a nap.
  health sleep note                Set or remove the note of a night of sleep.
  health sleep daily               Show daily sleep statistics for a date range
                                   (at most 28 days).
  health sleep weekly              Show weekly sleep statistics for the 52 weeks
                                   up to a date.
  health sleep overall             Show overall sleep statistics for a date
                                   range.
  health stress view               Show stress data for a date.
  health stress daily              Show daily stress statistics for a date
                                   range.
  health stress weekly             Show weekly stress data.
  health respiration view          Show respiration data for a date.
  health respiration daily         Show daily respiration statistics for a date
                                   range.
  health spo2                      Show SpO2 (blood oxygen) data.
  health hrv                       Show heart rate variability data.
  health snapshots list            List Health Snapshot sessions up to a date.
  health snapshots show            Show the summary of a Health Snapshot
                                   session.
  health snapshots epochs          Show the measurements of a Health Snapshot
                                   session.
  health body-battery view         Show body battery data for a date.
  health body-battery range        Show body battery data for a date range.
  health body-battery daily        Show the daily low and high body battery for
                                   a date range (at most 28 days).
  health intensity-minutes view    Show intensity minutes for a date.
  health intensity-minutes weekly
                                   Show weekly intensity minutes for a date
                                   range.
  health training-readiness        Show training readiness data.
  health training-status view      Show aggregated training status for a date.
  health training-status daily     Show daily training status for a date.
  health training-status weekly    Show weekly training status for a date range.
  health fitness-age               Show fitness age data.
  health max-metrics               Show VO2max and max metrics data.
  health lactate-threshold         Show latest lactate threshold.
  health cycling-ftp               Show latest cycling FTP.
  health critical-swim-speed view
                                   Show latest critical swim speed as of a date.
  health critical-swim-speed range
                                   Show critical swim speed for a date range.
  health power-to-weight           Show latest power-to-weight data as of a
                                   date.
  health thresholds cycling-ftp    Show cycling FTP for a date range.
  health thresholds lactate-heart-rate
                                   Show lactate threshold heart rate for a date
                                   range.
  health thresholds lactate-speed
                                   Show lactate threshold speed for a date
                                   range.
  health thresholds power-to-weight
                                   Show power-to-weight data for a date range.
  health race-predictions view     Show current race predictions.
  health race-predictions range    Show race predictions for a date range.
  health endurance-score view      Show endurance score data for a date.
  health endurance-score stats     Show endurance score statistics for a date
                                   range (at most 400 days).
  health hill-score view           Show hill score data for a date.
  health hill-score stats          Show hill score statistics for a date range
                                   (at most 400 days).
  health power-curve               Show power curve for a date range.
  health running-tolerance         Show running tolerance for a date range.
  health cycling-ability           Show cycling ability for a date range.
  health progress summary          Show activity totals per period for a date
                                   range.
  health progress activities       Show metric values of each activity in a date
                                   range.
  health progress metrics          List the metrics of each activity type.
  health running-economy           Show latest running economy as of a date.
  health acclimation range         Show acclimation data for a date range.
  health acclimation daily         Show SpO2 acclimation for a date.
  health one-rep-max               Show current estimated one-rep max values as
                                   of a date.
  health events                    Show daily wellness events.
  health lifestyle                 Show lifestyle logging data.
  body composition                 Show body composition data.
  body weigh-ins                   Show weigh-in data for a date range.
  body daily-weigh-ins             Show weigh-in data for a single day.
  body latest                      Show the latest weigh-in as of a date.
  body weekly                      Show weekly weight summaries for the 52 weeks
                                   that end on a date.
  body add-weight                  Add a weigh-in entry.
  body add-composition             Add body composition data (weight, body fat,
                                   muscle mass, etc.) via FIT upload.
  body delete-weight               Delete a weigh-in entry.
  body blood-pressure              Show blood pressure data.
  body add-blood-pressure          Add a blood pressure measurement.
  body delete-blood-pressure       Delete a blood pressure entry.
  body glucose                     Show glucose readings for a date.
  devices list                     List registered devices.
  devices settings                 Show settings for a device.
  devices primary                  Show primary training device.
  devices set-primary-tracker      Set the primary activity tracker (not the
                                   'devices primary' training device).
  devices solar                    Show solar charging data for a device.
  devices alarms                   Show alarms from all devices.
  devices last-used                Show last used device.
  devices sensors                  List paired sensors.
  devices backups summary          Show device backup summary.
  devices backups list             List device backups.
  devices historical               List historical devices.
  devices messages list            List device messages.
  devices messages cancel          Cancel a device message, such as a sent
                                   workout, before the device syncs.
  gear list                        List all gear.
  gear stats                       Show usage statistics for a gear item.
  gear activities                  Show activities linked to a gear item.
  gear defaults                    Show default gear per activity type.
  gear link                        Link gear to an activity.
  gear unlink                      Unlink gear from an activity.
  gear set-default                 Make a gear item a default gear for an
                                   activity type.
  gear unset-default               Stop a gear item being a default gear for an
                                   activity type.
  gear types                       List gear types.
  gear models                      Search the Garmin list of gear brands and
                                   models.
  gear add                         Add a gear item.
  gear update                      Change the name, brand, model or notes of a
                                   gear item.
  gear retire                      Retire a gear item.
  gear unretire                    Make a retired gear item active again.
  gear delete                      Delete a gear item.
  gear collections list            List gear collections.
  gear collections create          Create a gear collection.
  gear collections rename          Rename a gear collection.
  gear collections add             Add a gear item to a gear collection.
  gear collections remove          Remove a gear item from a gear collection.
                                   The gear item stays.
  gear collections delete          Delete a gear collection. The gear items
                                   stay.
  goals list                       List goals.
  goals add                        Add an activity goal.
  goals update                     Change an activity goal.
  goals delete                     Delete an activity goal.
  goals effective                  Show the daily goal of one type that applies
                                   on a date.
  goals weight view                Show the effective weight goal for a date
                                   range.
  goals weight set                 Set the weight goal.
  goals weight delete              Delete the current weight goal. An earlier
                                   weight goal then applies again.
  goals set                        Set the daily goal for floors climbed,
                                   intensity minutes or hydration.
  goals steps set                  Set a fixed daily steps goal.
  goals steps auto                 Set Garmin's automatic steps goal.
  badges earned                    Show earned badges.
  badges available                 Show available badges.
  badges in-progress               Show badges in progress.
  badges detail                    Show details of a badge.
  badges compare                   Compare your badges with a connection.
  badges leaderboard               Show the badge points leaderboard of your
                                   connections.
  courses list                     List courses.
  courses favorites                List favorite courses.
  courses detail                   View course details.
  courses download                 Download course file.
  courses import                   Import a GPX file as a new course.
  courses send                     Send a course to a device.
  courses delete                   Delete a course.
  segments list                    List the segments you created, or your
                                   favorites with --favorites.
  segments search                  Search segments by name or map area.
  segments show                    Show a segment with its track points.
  segments leaderboard             Show the leaderboard of a segment.
  segments rank                    Show your best time and the top three on a
                                   segment.
  segments classifications         List the segment classifications.
  segments surface-types           List the segment surface types.
  segments create                  Create a segment from a part of an activity
                                   track.
  segments favorite                Add a segment to your favorites.
  segments unfavorite              Remove a segment from your favorites.
  segments delete                  Delete a segment that you created.
  challenges list                  Show current challenges.
  challenges badge                 Show joined badge challenges that are not
                                   completed.
  challenges available             Show available badge challenges.
  challenges completed             Show completed badge challenges.
  challenges virtual available     Show available virtual challenges.
  challenges virtual completed     Show completed virtual challenges.
  challenges virtual in-progress
                                   Show virtual challenges in progress.
  challenges show                  Show a badge or virtual challenge.
  challenges join                  Join a badge or virtual challenge.
  challenges leave                 Leave a badge or virtual challenge.
  challenges adhoc list            Show your ad-hoc challenges that are not
                                   finished.
  challenges adhoc history         Show your finished ad-hoc challenges.
  challenges adhoc show            Show an ad-hoc challenge.
  challenges adhoc create          Create an ad-hoc challenge and invite people
                                   who follow you and whom you follow.
  challenges adhoc invites         List the open invites of an ad-hoc challenge
                                   with their adHocChallengeInviteId.
  challenges adhoc invite          Invite people who follow you and whom you
                                   follow to an ad-hoc challenge.
  challenges adhoc accept          Accept an invite to an ad-hoc challenge.
  challenges adhoc decline         Decline an invite to an ad-hoc challenge.
  challenges adhoc leave           Leave an ad-hoc challenge. Only a new invite
                                   gets you back in.
  challenges adhoc delete          Delete an ad-hoc challenge that you created.
  records list                     View personal records.
  records types                    List personal record types.
  records activity                 List the personal records set in an activity.
  records candidates list          List the personal record candidates that wait
                                   for your review.
  records candidates accept        Accept a personal record candidate as a
                                   personal record.
  records candidates dismiss       Dismiss a personal record candidate. This
                                   cannot be undone.
  records hide                     Hide a personal record type on the records
                                   page.
  records unhide                   Show a hidden personal record type on the
                                   records page again.
  records delete                   Delete a personal record. This cannot be
                                   undone.
  profile view                     Show user profile.
  profile settings                 Show user settings.
  profile privacy view             Show privacy settings.
  profile privacy set              Change who can see your profile, activities,
                                   wellness data and badges.
  profile privacy-zones list       List privacy zones.
  profile privacy-zones add        Add a privacy zone around a point.
  profile privacy-zones delete     Delete a privacy zone.
  profile hr-zones                 Show heart rate zones.
  profile power-zones list         Show power zones for all sports.
  profile power-zones sport        Show power zones for one sport.
  hydration view                   Show hydration data for a date.
  hydration daily                  Show daily hydration statistics for a date
                                   range.
  hydration weekly                 Show weekly hydration statistics.
  hydration add                    Add a hydration log entry.
  nutrition food-log               Show daily food log for a date.
  nutrition meals                  Show meal summaries for a date.
  nutrition settings               Show nutrition settings for a date.
  nutrition search                 Search the Garmin food database. Needs Garmin
                                   Connect+.
  nutrition recent                 List the foods you logged recently. Needs
                                   Garmin Connect+.
  nutrition add                    Log a food of the Garmin food database in a
                                   meal. Needs Garmin Connect+.
  nutrition quick-add              Log calories and macros in a meal without a
                                   food. Needs Garmin Connect+.
  nutrition delete                 Delete food log entries of a day. Needs
                                   Garmin Connect+.
  nutrition favorites list         List your favorite foods. Needs Garmin
                                   Connect+.
  nutrition favorites add          Add a food to your favorite foods. Needs
                                   Garmin Connect+.
  nutrition favorites remove       Remove a food from your favorite foods.
                                   Needs Garmin Connect+.
  training plans                   List training plans.
  training plan                    Show a specific training plan.
  training active                  Show active training plans.
  training search                  Search the Garmin catalog of training plans.
  training schedule                List the workouts and notes of a training
                                   plan by week and day.
  training join                    Join a catalog training plan and schedule its
                                   workouts in the calendar.
  training leave                   Leave a joined training plan and remove its
                                   workouts from the calendar.
  training task move               Move a workout of a joined training plan to
                                   another day.
  training task delete             Delete a workout of a joined training plan.
                                   Garmin puts a rest day in its place.
  training coach-workouts          List adaptive coaching workout types.
  events list                      List calendar events.
  events upcoming                  List upcoming events.
  events add                       Add a calendar event.
  events delete                    Delete a calendar event.
  calendar month                   List the items of a calendar month, such as
                                   activities and notes.
  calendar notes add               Add a note to a calendar day.
  calendar notes update            Change the name or text of a calendar note.
  calendar notes move              Move a calendar note to another day.
  calendar notes delete            Delete a calendar note.
  calendar export show             Show the calendar feed URL.
  calendar export enable           Turn on the calendar feed and show its URL.
  calendar export disable          Turn off the calendar feed. Its URL then
                                   gives an empty answer.
  calendar preferences view        Show the calendar preferences.
  calendar preferences set         Turn a calendar preference on or off.
  wellness menstrual-cycle         Show the menstrual cycle day view of a date.
  wellness menstrual-summary       Show the menstrual cycle summary of a date.
  wellness menstrual-calendar      Show the menstrual cycle calendar for a date
                                   range.
  wellness menstrual-log view      Show the menstrual daily log of a date.
  wellness menstrual-log set       Change the menstrual daily log of a date.
                                   Other fields keep their values.
  wellness menstrual-log delete    Delete the menstrual daily log of a date.
  wellness pregnancy-summary       Show pregnancy summary.
  wellness jet-lag list            List jet lag trips.
  wellness jet-lag add             Add a jet lag trip of a flight and an
                                   optional return flight.
  wellness jet-lag update          Change the places or times of a jet lag trip.
  wellness jet-lag delete          Delete a jet lag trip.
  wellness jet-lag status          Show jet lag status for a date.
  exercises list                   List available exercise categories and
                                   exercises.
  notifications list               List notifications.
  notifications unread             Show whether there are unread notifications.
  notifications dismiss            Dismiss a notification. Use 'notifications
                                   undismiss' to bring it back.
  notifications undismiss          Bring back a dismissed notification.
  notifications preferences view
                                   Show notification preferences.
  notifications preferences set    Turn a notification preference on or off.
  social connections               List your connections.
  social followers                 List the followers of a user.
  social following                 List the users that a user follows.
  social requests                  List pending connection requests.
  social feed                      Show your newsfeed.
  social follow                    Follow a user. A user with a private profile
                                   gets a follow request.
  social unfollow                  Stop following a user.
  social follow-requests           List the users who asked to follow you.
  social accept                    Accept the follow request of a user.
  social decline                   Decline the follow request of a user.
  social remove-follower           Remove a user from your followers.
  social mute                      Mute a user that you follow.
  social unmute                    Unmute a user.
  social muted                     List the users that you muted.
  social search                    Search Garmin Connect users by name.
  groups list                      List your groups.
  groups search                    Search groups by keyword.
  groups show                      Show a group.
  groups members                   List the members of a group.
  groups feed                      Show the latest posts and activities of the
                                   group feed.
  groups activities                List the latest activities of the group
                                   members.
  groups challenges                List the open challenges of a group. Garmin
                                   answers 403 to a non-member.
  groups join                      Join a public group. gccli does not send the
                                   request that a private group needs.
  groups leave                     Leave a group.
  insights options                 List the genders, ages, dates, activities and
                                   fields for insights compare.
  insights compare                 Compare a metric with your age group.
                                   Needs Insights on in Garmin Connect.
  insights preferences             Show your saved Insights comparisons.
  golf scorecards                  List your golf scorecards.
  golf courses                     List the golf courses you played.
  golf stats                       Show your golf statistics.
  golf shot-stats                  Show your golf shot statistics of one shot
                                   type.
  golf clubs                       List the golf clubs in your bag.
  golf club-types                  List the golf club types with their loft and
                                   lie angles.
  golf leaderboards                List the golf leaderboards you played in.
  reload                           Request data reload for a date.
  completion                       Generate shell completion script.

Run "gccli <command> --help" for more information on a command.

$ gccli auth --help
Usage: gccli auth <command> [flags]

Manage authentication.

Flags:
  -h, --help              Show context-sensitive help.
  -j, --json              Output as JSON ($GCCLI_JSON).
      --plain             Output as plain text (TSV) ($GCCLI_PLAIN).
      --header            Print the column names as the first line of --plain
                          output ($GCCLI_HEADER).
      --color="auto"      Color mode: auto, always, never ($GCCLI_COLOR).
      --account=STRING    Garmin account email ($GCCLI_ACCOUNT).
      --units="auto"      Unit system for distances, speeds, paces,
                          elevations and weights in table and plain output:
                          auto (Garmin profile), metric, statute_us, statute_uk
                          ($GCCLI_UNITS).
      --version           Print version information.

Commands:
  auth login     Log in to Garmin Connect.
  auth status    Show authentication status.
  auth remove    Remove stored credentials.
  auth token     Print current access token, refreshing it first when expired.
  auth export    Export credentials for transfer to another machine.
  auth import    Import credentials from another machine.

